  "description": "Two bikes in one.\n\nA bike that can be converted from a road to a gravel bike in no time, changing its geometry in the process.\n\nPacked Full Of Great Stuff!\n\nNot too much and not too little. The 8bar MITTE is equipped with the most important, but still looks chic and is not perforated like a Swiss cheese with countless eyelets. In addition to three bottle holders, the frame offers you the possibility to install fenders. For this, however, you need the Gravel fork in your selection.\n\nMore comfort = More fun!\n\nTires up to 45mm wide at 28\" and 50mm at 27.5\" are no problem in the Gravel setup. The lowered seat stays not only look good, but also increase the comfort.\n\nPower is everything!\n\nWith powerful hydraulic disc brakes, you're perfectly equipped for demanding descents and trails.",
